# Smoke tests of the brgemm inner product (brgemm:rvv) at its edges: OC around
# the dispatch threshold (16) and the kernel's M tile, IC below 64, OC tails,
# on both sides of the MB guards, with blocked and plain weights. ab weights
# fall back to the gemm inner product (f32) or the reference.

--reset
--dt=f32,bf16:bf16:f32,f16:f16:f32,f16:f16:f16
--dir=FWD_B
--mb=1,4,32
--stag=any --dtag=any
--wtag=any,ba
ic64oc15n"oc_below_16"
ic64oc16n"oc_16"
ic64oc17n"oc_17"
ic63oc64n"ic_below_64"
ic256oc100n"oc_tail"
ic520oc72n"ic_oc_tails"
--wtag=ab
ic256oc64n"ab"
